WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:05.880
The thing that's made RStudio, and now&nbsp;
Posit, so amazing is the community.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:12.240
We love and value our open source community&nbsp;
and we're so appreciative of everyone who's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.698
helped make Posit what it is today. 

00:00:14.698 --> 00:00:16.557
And our&nbsp;community is YOU! 

00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:19.400
You live and work on every&nbsp;continent. 

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:24.420
And one of the most used data&nbsp;sets for 
teaching is even from Antarctica.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:30.370
You use R for school or work or fun, answering&nbsp;
questions that are important to you.

00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:38.340
You work on&nbsp;projects in education, science, marketing, public&nbsp;
health, government, economics, finance, libraries,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:45.540
astronomy and so, so much more. You create and&nbsp;
share thousands of resources to help others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:51.420
You contribute to code and documentation on&nbsp;
hundreds of Open Source projects. You're involved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:57.120
in the community, sharing with each other in your&nbsp;
organizations and in user groups around the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:04.620
And, of course, you write millions of lines of&nbsp;
code. Thanks to you, R is one of today's top&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:12.000
10 programming languages. I've been using R for&nbsp;
almost 20 years now, and the transformation of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.900
language and the community just blows my mind.&nbsp;
I'm so awed and grateful for all that we have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:24.120
built together. And I, and everyone at Posit,&nbsp;
wishes you all the best for the coming year.

